{
  "$description": "Phamily Pharma (phamilypharma.com) design tokens — W3C DTCG. ITCSS/BEM, Anton (display) + Poppins (body). Root font-size 10px (1rem=10px). No 3D. Typography computed at desktop (>=1025px); some use clamp() and scale down on smaller viewports.",
